messages[5]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hi Ravi I'm calling about my auto policy I got your email and I'm still a bit confused about the difference between reinstating and buying a new one
  user_2,Ah Diya good morning Yeah I'd be happy to clarify that for you again So reinstating your old policy would mean we'd just update the dates and you'd be covered again under the same terms
  user_1,Okay that sounds simple enough But what about the new policy option you mentioned What's the benefit of going with that
  user_2,Well Diya our new policies have some updated features and better coverage options For example we've added roadside assistance and a more comprehensive collision coverage
  user_1,That sounds great actually I think I'd like to go with the new policy Can you walk me through the next steps